+/**
+ * create_aapl_rsp_buf() - build AAPL kAAPL_SERVER_QUERY response
+ * @cc:         buffer to write the create context into (AAPL_RSP_MAX_SIZE bytes)
+ * @vol_caps:   volume capability flags (SMB2_CRTCTX_AAPL_* volume bits)
